   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENG303 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Ngữ pháp tiếng Anh nâng cao — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13756 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENG303 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Ngữ pháp tiếng Anh nâng cao — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13756 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">ENG303</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Advanced English Grammar_Ngữ pháp tiếng Anh nâng cao</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 104 hours of self-study + 1 hour for the final exam<br>1 session = 45 minutes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13756</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 11/27/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">11/27/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">ENG303</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Advanced English Grammar_Ngữ pháp tiếng Anh nâng cao</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h) = 45 contact hours (60 sessions) + 104 hours of self-study + 1 hour for the final exam<br>1 session = 45 minutes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13756</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 11/27/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">11/27/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>The course is designed to consolidate and enhance students' grammatical knowledge. It aims to achieve this by giving learners exposure to grammar as it is used in real life situations, offering them comprehensive explanations for grammatical forms and meanings, providing contextualized practice of various structures, and developing their use of such structures as well as their critical thinking skills through communicative activities. Students will also be informed of how to recognize common grammatical errors in their written work and encouraged to apply learned grammar in writing. Utilizing a flipped classroom approach, they will engage with core grammar concepts and materials independently before class sessions. They are also encouraged to leverage AI tools as resources to support their grammar learning, practice, and writing processes.</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>Progress marks:<br>- 02 Mini Projects: 30%<br>- 03 Progress tests: 30%<br>Final exam: 40%<br>Conditions to pass:<br>Each on-going assessment's component's mark: &gt;=3/10<br>Each progress tests' components' mark &gt;0<br>Each final exam's components' mark &gt;0<br>Final exam's mark: &gt;=4/10<br>Grade average &gt;=5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>The course is designed to consolidate and enhance students' grammatical knowledge. It aims to achieve this by giving learners exposure to grammar as it is used in real life situations, offering them comprehensive explanations for grammatical forms and meanings, providing contextualized practice of various structures, and developing their use of such structures as well as their critical thinking skills through communicative activities. Students will also be informed of how to recognize common grammatical errors in their written work and encouraged to apply learned grammar in writing. Utilizing a flipped classroom approach, they will engage with core grammar concepts and materials independently before class sessions. They are also encouraged to leverage AI tools as resources to support their grammar learning, practice, and writing processes.</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>Progress marks:<br>- 02 Mini Projects: 30%<br>- 03 Progress tests: 30%<br>Final exam: 40%<br>Conditions to pass:<br>Each on-going assessment's component's mark: &gt;=3/10<br>Each progress tests' components' mark &gt;0<br>Each final exam's components' mark &gt;0<br>Final exam's mark: &gt;=4/10<br>Grade average &gt;=5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13756</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13756</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
